<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Storage prices at $7.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Storage prices at $7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	   Storage Dimensions Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $7</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $7 - $8</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,700,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	     Smith Barney Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company lowered the proposed number of shares for its planned initial public offering to 2.7 million shares from 3.8 million shares previously.</p>
<p>The company lowered the estimated price range for its planned initial public offering to $7 to $8 from $8.50 to $10.50 previously.</p>
</text>
